00:34:48.690 --> 00:34:52.800
So, let's go work on the new Jaguar from
8:00 to 8:10, then we'll work on

00:34:52.800 --> 00:34:55.456
the new Edge from 8:10 to 8:20, can

00:34:55.456 --> 00:34:57.250
you imagine doing that for 97 different
things.

00:34:58.260 --> 00:35:04.940
Business, the days when people would pay
you to manage a conglomerate, are over.

00:35:04.940 --> 00:35:09.350
Information is ubiquitous, people wanna
know exactly what that brand stands for.

00:35:09.350 --> 00:35:11.930
And what to expect when they walk in that
Ford's door, right?

00:35:11.930 --> 00:35:12.720
And now they know.

00:35:12.720 --> 00:35:14.100
It's Ford.

00:35:14.100 --> 00:35:15.330
Full family.

00:35:15.330 --> 00:35:16.310
Small, medium and large.

00:35:16.310 --> 00:35:17.340
Cars, utilities, trucks.

00:35:17.340 --> 00:35:19.700
Best in class, in quality, filters and
safety.

00:35:19.700 --> 00:35:22.550
And you've gotta have a laser focus on
that branch.

00:35:22.550 --> 00:35:24.630
All the suppliers know what the plan is.

00:35:24.630 --> 00:35:26.658
All of your [UNKNOWN] customers know what
the plan is.

00:35:26.658 --> 00:35:30.130
So, I think.

00:35:30.130 --> 00:35:33.500
What that did to, almost unleash all the
talent inside for

00:35:33.500 --> 00:35:36.200
it because now, everybody knew what we
were coming to work for.

00:35:36.200 --> 00:35:38.280
They knew what we were going to do, and

00:35:38.280 --> 00:35:40.700
that just created this, add that to the
business

00:35:40.700 --> 00:35:43.120
plan review process and the creating value
road map

00:35:43.120 --> 00:35:45.910
where you actually have to create value
every year.

00:35:45.910 --> 00:35:48.250
Because this is, it's a discounted cash
flow right?

00:35:48.250 --> 00:35:50.000
It's a wonderful think a discounted cash
flow right?

00:35:50.000 --> 00:35:51.110
All you gotta do is fill the arrows in.

00:35:52.290 --> 00:35:53.880
The arrow's up and the arrow's down.

00:35:53.880 --> 00:35:56.930
And if you're in business, good businesses
grow at discounted cash

00:35:56.930 --> 00:35:59.190
flow whether it's cash or profits by 15% a
year, right?

00:35:59.190 --> 00:36:01.618
And most good companies grow the top line
by

00:36:01.618 --> 00:36:04.340
7% a year, by making price [INAUDIBLE]
along value.

00:36:04.340 --> 00:36:08.261
And then they also improve their
productivity by 7%.

00:36:08.261 --> 00:36:11.492
And what's 1.07 times 1.07?

00:36:11.492 --> 00:36:13.030
1.15.

00:36:13.030 --> 00:36:14.324
That's how you grow 15% a year.

00:36:14.324 --> 00:36:16.670
That's what good companies do.

00:36:16.670 --> 00:36:20.110
So it's just absolutely unleashed all the
talent around the world.

00:36:20.110 --> 00:36:22.508
By, by focusing the vision, what we are,
and the

00:36:22.508 --> 00:36:24.339
comprehensive strategy and then that

00:36:24.339 --> 00:36:27.044
relentless implementation part by working
together.

00:36:27.044 --> 00:36:28.121
Make sense?

